  "title": "Bit Digital, Inc. Announces Date for Third Quarter 2025 Financial Results and Conference Call",
  "summary": "Bit Digital, Inc. (Nasdaq: BTBT), today announced that it will release its financial results for the third quarter ended September 30, 2025, before the market opens on Friday, November 14, 2025. Senior management will host a live webcast and conference call to discuss the results at 9:00 a.m. Eastern Time on the same day.",
